cloud service models -> How cloud services and resources are delivered to an enduser

IAAS -> Infrastructure as a service -> Actual purchase of real computing resources -> rent servers and manage compute on our own -> This needs specialized skills (DevOps) -> usually done by developers -> planning --> design ---> build ---> test ---> deploy ---> maintain PAAS --> Platform as a service ---> allows developers to build and deploy applications without having to manage infrastructure -> use existing easy to use platforms to deploy applications e.g netlify , heroku , vercel SAAS ----> softwware as a service ---> ready to use applications that are deployed on the cloud --> e.g. Google drive , Icloud , Netflix

